sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as main.py
    participant Spider as Scrapy Spider
    participant Logger as Logger (file+console)
    participant Email as email.py (send_email)
    participant SMTP as SMTP Server
    participant Rec as Recipient

    Main->>Spider: start crawl (start_date, end_date)
    Spider->>Logger: log events (console + transparency_job.log)
    Spider-->>Main: finished (jobs list, record_count) or error
    Main->>Email: send_email(jobs, record_count)
    Email->>Email: build_email() (count statuses, generate HTML + plain text)
    Email->>SMTP: connect, starttls, login
    Email->>SMTP: sendmail(msg)
    SMTP-->>Rec: deliver email
    Email-->>Main: return success / print error
    Main->>Logger: log final status
